1
00:00:00,698 --> 00:00:04,488
l gotta hand it to Raj. He found
a really nice spot to have a bachelor party.

2
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:09,210
(Sheldon:)It's not bad. Unless you compare it
to a train. And then it stinks.

3
00:00:11,208 --> 00:00:13,668
- Are you drinking whiskey?
- lndeed.

4
00:00:14,128 --> 00:00:18,008
(Sheldon:)If I'm to participate in the social convention
that is the stag night...

5
00:00:18,173 --> 00:00:20,463
(Sheldon:)...then I must embrace
all its components...

6
00:00:20,634 --> 00:00:25,434
(Sheldon:)...including tobacco, swear words
and, yes, alcohol.

7
00:00:27,224 --> 00:00:29,564
Jeepers, that's yucky.

8
00:00:31,645 --> 00:00:35,525
(Leonard:)Whoa, it's a little early to start dropping
J- bombs, don't you think?

9
00:00:36,942 --> 00:00:40,322
- Hey, you guys.
- Hey. Nice of you to make it out for Howard.

10
00:00:40,487 --> 00:00:44,367
(Wil:)It was either this or another
hot tub party at George Takei's house.

11
00:00:44,742 --> 00:00:47,532
(Sheldon:)I'm confused.
l thought since our reconciliation...

12
00:00:47,703 --> 00:00:49,413
...l was your friend in this group.

13
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:51,660
- Oh, I'm friends with Howard too.
- Oh.

14
00:00:51,832 --> 00:00:57,022
l guess you're just friends with anybody.

